The MIT licence above applies to the PHCP source code, tools, tests and
documentation written for this project.  It does not, and cannot, license
material that belongs to others:

  data/pipes.dat
      The pipe and fitting database.  Its pipe dimensions and fitting
      equivalent lengths reproduce values published in
      AS 1074, AS 2118.1:2017 (Standards Australia), FM Global Property Loss
      Prevention Data Sheet 3-0, TYCO/BlazeMaster IH-1900, ASME B36.10M and
      the Plastics Pipe Institute Handbook of PE Pipe.  Those values remain
      the copyright of their publishers and are used under their terms.

  data/fonts/DejaVuSansMono.ttf, data/fonts/DejaVuSansMono-Bold.ttf
      The typeface the PDF report is set in, embedded in each PDF.  The
      DejaVu fonts are Copyright (c) 2003 Bitstream, Inc., with the DejaVu
      changes in the public domain, and are distributed under the Bitstream
      Vera font licence in data/fonts/LICENSE-DejaVu.txt.

  Tk
      Required to run the text editor and the viewer, installed separately,
